Third-party components
----------------------
EagleWings depends on third-party packages that keep their own licenses.
They are installed separately and are not bundled with this distribution.

Notably, the optional computer-vision branches (requirements/cv.txt) use
Ultralytics YOLO, which is licensed under AGPL-3.0. Using those branches
brings the obligations of AGPL-3.0 for that component. The core pipeline
(requirements/ds.txt) does not require it.
